---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Terms of Service — Rashi Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Terms of Service</h1>

    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      By using Rashi Kundali, you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Service Description</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Rashi Kundali provides Vedic astrology reports based on birth chart analysis. Reports are generated automatically using astrological calculations and traditional interpretation principles.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">No Guarantee of Outcomes</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Astrology reports are for informational and guidance purposes only. Results may vary by individual. We do not guarantee any specific outcomes based on our reports.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Payments</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      All payments are processed securely through Razorpay or Cashfree. We do not store your credit card or banking details. Prices are in Indian Rupees (INR) and include all applicable taxes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Refunds</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      We offer a 24-hour no-questions-asked refund policy. See our <a href="/refund" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Refund Policy</a> for details.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      The generated report is licensed to you for personal use. You may not resell, redistribute, or publicly share your report without our written permission.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Our total liability shall not exceed the amount you paid for the report. We are not responsible for any decisions made based on the report content.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of our service constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid #f0e6d6;padding-top:1rem">
      Last updated: September 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
